  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "This red and black letterman jacket suits students and teams looking for a strong two-tone look. The red body and black sleeves give group outfits a clear color combination while leaving space for individual details.\n\nDetails\n- Body: red 24 oz melton wool\n- Sleeves: black genuine cowhide leather\n- Trim: red and black striped knit collar, cuffs and waistband\n- Lining: quilted lining\n- Closure: snap-button front\n- Pockets: two welt pockets\n- Fit: True-to-size fit; compare your measurements with the size guide\n- Sizes: XXS through 6XL\n\nCustomization options\n- Chenille letter and name embroidery\n- Number, patches and back lettering\n- Free digital design proof before production.\n\nExplore red and black varsity jacket styling or letterman jacket red with black sleeves with your own personal details. Choose your layout through our [custom letterman jacket](/custom-letterman-jackets) options and review the placement before production.\n\nProduction and delivery\nMade in our Sialkot factory. Made in 6–7 business days after design approval. Delivery in 5–7 business days.",
